      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Every instance I've seen of Steam Audio has been poorly implemented with plenty of bugs. Tarkov (also Unity 2019) even just ditched Steam Audio in favor of Oculus Audio because of all the issues they've had with Steam Audio. And I can say based on my experience with CS:GO (Nuke anyone?), Tarkov, and VRChat, the audio in VRChat seems to be much more directional and higher quality.\n\nUnless there's something I don't know about Steam Audio being good or well implemented, I think instead of implementing Steam Audio, the ONSP/Oculus Audio implementation should be improved.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
