      "value": "@{6177ddf059c9a80ef7174d60|full_name}: I mean if it can be done correclty, I am all for it. I've been waiting for proper occlusion and reflection of audio, especially for the worlds I'm in, since it would bring up the immersion that much more.\n\nI just haven't seen any good examples, and only a few examples where it was bad. I will check out Alyx again though. Thanks.",
